/* Honour user motion preferences. The drifting page gradient is the
   exact kind of background motion that triggers vestibular discomfort
   for some users. */
/* ----- Action buttons --------------------------------------------------- */
/* Required by SCHEMA.md. Each theme owns its `.btn-*` palette so consumer
 * apps inherit theme-coherent button styling. Frosted Glass leans cyan on
